{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832300/extras/Project_Glin_-_Description_Banner.png?t=1742007138\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Brave Glin, a little magical creature that getting lost in a forest, nedding face dangers on the way to return home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Freatures -</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u220e Jump! Use enemies as platforms by jumping over their heads! Each enemy has a different reaction when they are trampled!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u220e Defend Yourself! Use a slingshot, a shield and even a stick to defend yourself from enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u220e Super Star! Collect tiny stars, defeat enemies, increasing the experience bar to can collect the great Shooting Stars! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u220e 4 Thematic Worlds! Meet many charismatic characters, crossing the world of Fairyaria!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u220e Friends! The scarecrow Hans and the crow Crowie will help you on the journey! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832300/extras/Project_Glin_-_Kids_Gif.gif?t=1742007138\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832300/extras/Project_Glin_-_Shooting_Star_Gif.gif?t=1742007138\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832300/extras/Project_Glin_-_Boss_Battle_Gif.gif?t=1742007138\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2832300?t=1742007138","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag